WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.008 --> 00:00:17.469
It was late at night. A prison bus waited outside Metro City Prison.

2
00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:22.659
A guard came out of the prison and looked around.

3
00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.089
"It's all clear. Bring out the prisoner."

4
00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:29.920
Another guard came out.

5
00:00:29.921 --> 00:00:33.761
A clown in handcuffs stood next to her.

6
00:00:33.762 --> 00:00:38.507
Suddenly several figures jumped out of the darkness.

7
00:00:38.508 --> 00:00:45.265
"Oh no!" the first guard cried. "More clowns!"

8
00:00:45.266 --> 00:00:49.821
"I am not looking forward to school today," Jack said.

9
00:00:49.822 --> 00:00:54.348
"We're going to be stuck in class all day!"

10
00:00:54.349 --> 00:00:57.489
Roxy and her friends were walking to school.

11
00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:59.489
Mara scratched her head.

12
00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:02.676
"I thought a magician was coming today.

13
00:01:02.677 --> 00:01:07.242
He was going to do a magic show for the entire school."

14
00:01:07.243 --> 00:01:11.453
"Didn't you get the email from Principal Penn last night?" Terrell asked.

15
00:01:11.454 --> 00:01:16.687
"The magician has the flu, so there's no show today."

16
00:01:16.688 --> 00:01:20.003
Mara frowned. "That stinks."

17
00:01:20.004 --> 00:01:23.624
"I hope the magician gets better soon," Jack said.

18
00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:30.475
"Maybe he can make all of our teachers disappear!" He and Terrell laughed.

19
00:01:30.476 --> 00:01:33.049
Mara shook her head and sighed.

20
00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:38.161
"Maybe we can get a magician to make you two disappear."

21
00:01:38.162 --> 00:01:41.796
Mara pretended to wave a magic wand at Terrell and Jack.

22
00:01:41.797 --> 00:01:45.089
"Abracadabra, poof!"

23
00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:49.397
Roxy laughed. "Now that would be funny!"

24
00:01:49.398 --> 00:01:52.230
"I'd like to see an escape act," Jack said.

25
00:01:52.231 --> 00:01:55.132
"Once I saw a guy escape on TV.

26
00:01:55.133 --> 00:01:58.355
He was tied up in a big glass tank.

27
00:01:58.356 --> 00:02:01.537
He had to escape before the tank filled with water!"

28
00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:05.253
Jack folded his arms and pretended to struggle.

29
00:02:05.254 --> 00:02:06.934
Terrell looked at Roxy.

30
00:02:06.935 --> 00:02:09.955
"Maybe Rocket Girl could come to our school.

31
00:02:09.956 --> 00:02:12.752
She could show off all her super powers.

32
00:02:12.753 --> 00:02:18.535
That would be the best show ever!"

33
00:02:18.536 --> 00:02:22.062
"Why did Terrell look at me?" Roxy thought.

34
00:02:22.063 --> 00:02:25.580
"That would be pretty cool!" Mara said suddenly.

35
00:02:25.581 --> 00:02:27.849
"Yeah!" Jack said.

36
00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:33.317
Roxy shrugged. "I guess it would be cool," she said.

37
00:02:33.318 --> 00:02:37.584
"But I don't think Rocket Girl does school shows."

38
00:02:37.585 --> 00:02:40.938
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

39
00:02:40.939 --> 00:02:43.866
She stopped walking and opened her backpack.

40
00:02:43.867 --> 00:02:48.218
"Oh, um, did I remember my homework?"

41
00:02:48.226 --> 00:02:51.338
She waited until her friends had walked a little more.

42
00:02:51.339 --> 00:02:54.875
Terrell kept looking back at her.

43
00:02:54.876 --> 00:02:58.981
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered. "What's wrong?"

44
00:02:58.982 --> 00:03:03.120
"Bad news, Rocket Girl." The mayor looked very serious.

45
00:03:03.121 --> 00:03:07.397
"A dangerous criminal escaped from Metro City Prison late last night."

46
00:03:07.398 --> 00:03:10.031
"Who?" Roxy asked.

47
00:03:10.032 --> 00:03:15.010
"He's one of the most terrible, evil criminals in the city," Mayor Bloom said.

48
00:03:15.011 --> 00:03:19.038
"His name is Mr. Bubbles."

49
00:03:19.039 --> 00:03:23.884
Roxy raised an eyebrow. "His name is Mr. Bubbles?"

50
00:03:23.885 --> 00:03:25.988
Mayor Bloom nodded.

51
00:03:25.989 --> 00:03:32.612
Roxy shrugged. "Okay, Mayor. I'm on my way!"
